Parts of ElectroCAD are ported from DabbleCAD Plus, a fork of DabbleCAD
maintained by jonsole (https://github.com/jonsole/DabbleCAD):
  - the UI design tokens, component styles and layout (src/renderer/styles.css)
  - the DOM helpers, dialogs, menus, toasts and stroke-icon set (src/renderer/ui/dom.js)
  - the app shell, platform bridge, Electron main/preload process and smoke-test
    harness structure (src/renderer/app.js, src/renderer/platform.js, electron/, tools/)
  - the Laser workspace's canvas rulers and grid drawing (src/renderer/view/canvas2d.js)
  - the movable floating card and dockable panels (src/renderer/ui/draggable.js, from DabbleCAD's
    makeDraggable and ui/dock.js), and the column resizer (src/renderer/ui/resizer.js)

